  "title": "SPEC-PM-003 \u2014 Combination-Product Postmarket Regulatory Coordination Events",
  "description": "Document 113 event contract for 14 of the 15 event types Document 60 # 13 declares. `PeriodicDatasetFrozen` is not emitted as a distinct outbox event: freezePeriodicReportDataset() calls Document 58's buildPeriodicSafetyDataset() internally, which -- like Document 58's own calculateSurveillanceMetric() -- is a Vault-release read/write, not a Mutation Gateway command, and neither emits an outbox event (see event-pm-001.json's own description for the same pattern). Recorded here rather than silently fabricating a PeriodicDatasetFrozen outbox row that the code never actually produces. Updated 2026-09-14 (SG-160): added CorrectionRemovalAssessmentRequested/Signed and CorrectionRemovalReportabilitySigned for the new 2-signature chain ceremony (Document 106 rows 129/130).",
  "x-requirement-ids": [
    "PMO-FR-001",
    "PMO-FR-004",
    "PMO-FR-005",
    "PMO-FR-007",
    "PMO-FR-009",
    "PMO-FR-010",
    "PMO-FR-013",
    "PMO-FR-016",
    "PMO-FR-017",
    "PMO-FR-020",
    "PMO-FR-024",
    "PMO-FR-026",
    "PMO-FR-028",
    "EVT-FR-001",
    "CTRC-FR-008",
    "CTRC-FR-009"
  ],
